                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This ONE OF a kind game has ABSOLUTELY made me put the sequel on my list of MUST buys.  Similar to other classic greats like GalCiv 3/4, Distant Worlds, this series is something else.  One of the MORE interesting things is you can basically stretch the game AS BIG AS YOUR RIG can handle.  That is something that VERY few games do.  So if you have a TANK of a system, and want to see how far you can push the simulation...have at it.\nBIG PS:  This SECOND game was released OPEN SOURCE and WOW is it EVER GOOD like the first one :) https://github.com/OpenSRProject/OpenStarRuler-Launchpad/releases/tag/v2.0.0",
